# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Noise, and how to undo it {#3-noise-and-how-to-undo-it}"
msgstr "3. Noise, at paano ito aalisin {#3-noise-and-how-to-undo-it}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "A noisy simulation {#a-noisy-simulation}"
msgstr "Isang noisy na simulation {#a-noisy-simulation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now add noise: 1% two-qubit depolarizing noise on every CZ gate and a 3% readout error on every qubit, sampled with the Qiskit Aer sampler. With 144 CZ gates in the circuit, this is much less noise than the 8×8 hardware circuits see, but enough to see what it does. The simulation uses six couplings and 4,000 shots each, and takes about 1.5 minutes.\n"
"> **Question.** Before you run it: will noise make the system look more thermalized or less thermalized?\n"
msgstr ""
"Ngayon, magdagdag ng noise: 1% two-qubit depolarizing noise sa bawat CZ gate at 3% readout error sa bawat qubit, na sinample gamit ang Qiskit Aer sampler. Dahil may 144 CZ gate sa circuit, mas kaunti ito kaysa sa noise na nararanasan ng 8×8 hardware circuit, pero sapat na para makita ang epekto nito. Gumagamit ang simulation ng anim na coupling at tig-4,000 shot, at tumatagal nang mga 1.5 minuto.\n"
"> **Tanong.** Bago mo ito patakbuhin: magmumukha bang mas thermalized o mas hindi thermalized ang system dahil sa noise?\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "More. Noise scrambles the outcomes, which pushes every marginal distribution toward uniform, so the raw IPR drops and the entropy rises. Without mitigation, noise looks like thermalization that is not there, and the crossovers come out too early.\n"
msgstr "Mas thermalized. Ginugulo ng noise ang mga resulta, kaya napupunta sa uniform ang bawat marginal distribution, bumababa ang raw na IPR, at tumataas ang entropy. Kapag walang mitigation, magmumukhang may thermalization ang noise kahit wala naman, at masyadong maaga ang labas ng mga crossover.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
